# Install a service from source

Clone the project, install its declared language dependencies, then run `trellis update` and `trellis generate`. The CLI reads only native `.trellis` source and canonical installed artifacts; it never executes TypeScript or Rust authoring code.

For local API dependencies, use a `path` entry in `trellis.toml`. Registry dependencies remain exact and digest-verified through `trellis.lock`.
